    "description": "Whether you come by oafishness naturally or it is all an act, you use your lack of sophistication and finesse as an excuse to bluff your way into or out of delicate situations. Once per encounter, when you fail either a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> or a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> check, you can add a bonus equal to 1d6 + your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> modifier to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> check result.",
